ks for playing the demo and sharing your feedback! Here's what's new in this update:Balance & UpgradesAdded new upgrade levels for Hand and Pitchfork.Adjusted upgrade and tool prices and stats.Reduced the number of coins found in chests.Carrot Vision now has a limited duration, with updated UI information and a new cost of 100 coins.Increased fountain effect duration and reduced its cooldown.Other ChangesAdded new music.Renamed the starting area from Skylight Cave to Skylight Field.Made rake","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:37:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694691","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:31:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5152560-1846651706689864","game_id":"steam-5152560","kind":"announcement","title":"2,000+ Wishlists! Thank You for the Amazing Support! 🥕","summary":"We’ve reached over 2,000 wishlists in just a few days!A huge thank you to everyone who has added Quadrillion Carrots to their Wishlist! We’ve reached over 2,000 wishlists in just a few days, and it’s great to see so much interest in our game. 🥕Start by picking carrots by hand, then upgrade your tools and find new ways to get the job done. There’s a lot more to farming than you might expect!Haven’t added the game to your Wishlist yet? Now’s the perfect time!Thank you for supporting our little ind","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T11:47:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689864","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:31:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5152560":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:05:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:05:19Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5152560":"2026-10